  "details": "Yesterday i learned that VRChat is now available on mobile devices (iOS and Android). I did get excited, except that the app lacks the VR Mode.\n\nThere’s literally thousands of phone VR headset accessories. Using it along with a controller or hand tracking could have been great and no need for a Meta Quest or a PCVR headset.\n\nI know a headset isn’t required to play, but I do wanna get the full experience.\n\nDo you guys have any plans to implement it in the app?\n\nThanks.\n\n-GroovyMarco",
